KZ3 patch 1050 (SPU pass 35): KZ3_AUDIO_DIAG=1 mix diagnostics (holes per port with ring occupancy and the SPURS kernel threads' runs, port vs mix clipping, port-lock wait, backlog drops = the drift) and KZ3_AUDIO_PRIO=1 (mix thread TIME_CRITICAL, opt-in).

Rebased on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (SPU pass 108): context only (upstream v0.18.0 changed lines around the hunks; same change).

diff --git a/libs/audio/cellAudio.c b/libs/audio/cellAudio.c
